  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\frac{\\mathrm{x}}{\\mathrm{ma}}+\\frac{\\mathrm{y}}{\\mathrm{nb}}=1$ touches the ellipse $\\frac{x^{2}}{a^{2}}+\\frac{y^{2}}{b^{2}}=1,$ then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "djkH1",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{m}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}^{2}}{\\mathrm{n}^{2}-1}$ or $\\mathrm{n}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{m}^{2}}{\\mathrm{~m}^{2}-1}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NG0Hi",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{m}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}^{2}}{\\mathrm{n}^{2}+1}$ or $\\mathrm{n}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{m}^{2}}{\\mathrm{~m}^{2}+1}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DmlOb",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{m}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}^{2}+1}{\\mathrm{n}^{2}}$ or $\\mathrm{n}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{m}^{2}+1}{\\mathrm{~m}^{2}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wVreg",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{m}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}^{2}-1}{\\mathrm{n}^{2}}$ or $\\mathrm{n}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{m}^{2}-1}{\\mathrm{~m}^{2}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The line is $y=-\\frac{\\text { nb }}{\\text { ma }} x-n b$. It will touch the ellipse if $(-n b)^{2}=a^{2}\\left(-\\frac{n b}{m a}\\right)^{2}+b^{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\left[\\mathrm{c}^{2}=\\mathrm{a}^{2} \\mathrm{~m}^{2}+\\mathrm{b}^{2}\\right]$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow n^{2}=\\frac{n^{2}}{m^{2}}+1$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{m}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}^{2}}{\\mathrm{n}^{2}-1}$ or $\\mathrm{n}^{2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{m}^{2}}{\\mathrm{~m}^{2}-1}$",
    "image": null
  },
